<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山月.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―What <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> told us about was <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>'s uncle, <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> was the one <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Obasan</STYLE> believed to be the culprit.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山廃屋.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The reason was that he had been pushing <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE> to be able to fight with a nata and a mace.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, who hadn't known the outside world, came to think that hunting with weapons like those was strange, and apparently that was what first made her suspect <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山廃屋中.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Suspecting <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> over just that seems a little strange to me, though...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> talked it over with <STYLE ID="4">Obasan</STYLE>, who then asked <STYLE ID="6">my dad</STYLE> and the others whether they would come and help.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So you said </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> might be the culprit, and when you told </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, it turned into </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="おおげんか">a huge fight</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> doesn't want to believe </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">her own father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is the culprit. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Same here. I want to catch the culprit, and at the same time I want to prove </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> innocent. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Actually, it seems </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was going to tell the Motoki-cho group herself. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But I thought that once you got to the settlement, there wouldn't be much time to spare..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, is your intuition picking up anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"The thing is... ever since about when we came into these mountains, nothing at all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, right... There's only one cherry tree in Arata right now..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"In that case, the reason </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> ended up coming here doesn't really make sense, does it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Oh, I'm not saying </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">'s useless. It's more, without intuition, what kind of factor could </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> be..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right. It isn't necessarily <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="・・">only</STYLE> my intuition that's needed to solve the case.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Also, I should tell you this too, just in case. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The plan was actually for </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s parents to stay in the storage shed at Arata Station and come to the settlement if it came to that, but that's off now too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Huh!? They were supposed to come!? And now it's called off...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"See, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, your train was late, wasn't it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, the train you all took was the last one that goes to Arata, so if they'd taken it, they'd have run right into you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and the others. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">None of you were supposed to know about the curse-killings, so I hear your parents ended up staying in Motoki-cho."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">your grandmother</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> meant to tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> about the curse-killings, but she hadn't told anyone else what she was planning to say. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> was planning to keep the curse-killings from us. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">So you weren't as coordinated as I'd thought..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... As long as we don't know who the real culprit is, it's hard for any of us to talk things over with each other, at least where the case is concerned."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, once we get to the settlement, why not try going down to the foot of the mountain in </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s car?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"I see, so my intuition will kick in. Sounds like it's going to get busy..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... The reason I lied earlier and said 'I'd heard about the case from the very beginning' was that I had to hide the thing with </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s parents. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and I had gotten our stories straight, and I couldn't tell the three of you that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But that plan's off now anyway, so I decided there's no point hiding it."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Also, there's something called the succession rite tonight, and I was going to switch places with </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> then. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Because </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> might have attacked </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s parents."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"What!? </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, of all people, would do something like that!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s killer is someone she truly hates. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If she found out who it was, I think she'd kill them without hesitation. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> always used to tell us. If we found out who killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, we should kill them without hesitating... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would only have to tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> 'Whoever's in the storage shed has to be the culprit,' and then </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would probably..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"So, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, after switching places at the succession rite, you'd keep tabs on </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and make sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">'s parents didn't come to harm, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　Which means </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> hasn't given </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> any instructions yet?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Right, that's what's scary about </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">He</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> can apparently manipulate the people around him without ever lifting a finger himself. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So even the people who live here might turn against us."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Also, there was a time when we all kept watch over </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> in the meeting hall in April. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In April, from Shiyo 793 to 795, I think. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">We watched him the whole time, but the curse-killings happened anyway..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey now... We're actually heading into a place that scary...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"But it can't be helped. </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> said that's what we should do, so we have no choice..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Kind of... sorry..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, don't apologize! We know full well we're better off doing what you say, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"But I've got no intuition right now. Can I really be any help...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's fine, don't worry! I bet </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> knew that too when he called you guys out here, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Then what reason could there be for needing me...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"I see... Approaching it from that angle could be interesting."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> obviously isn't as sharp as </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, but if you're talking about what's amazing about her, it's her nerves of steel."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Like, she wouldn't talk even under torture?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Don't say scary things... So nothing comes to mind after all, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"No, wait just a second! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> had intuition like </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">'s, didn't she? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">'s biggest link to all this is right there, isn't it!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">My mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s intuition...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　You're right, that's one way to look at it. A link between the curse-killings and </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s intuition..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What was </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s intuition like? Sensing danger when the cherry trees bloom, I'm guessing?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I think so. When cherry season came, everyone used to go hear what </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had to say. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And that's how they decided things like the day's hunting route, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Was there something that triggered her awakening to that power? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="9">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> both got splashed with </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Niimura-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">'s blood, maybe?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I've never heard anything like that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And if I don't know, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> probably doesn't either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, were there cherry trees back then? </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> could use her intuition, right?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... There's only one cherry tree, at the Niimura main house. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's probably how </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> could use her intuition, but lately that tree hasn't been doing well... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> says it might be near the end of its life."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Why is there only one cherry tree in the first place? You'd think there would be a few more..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Around 70 years ago, someone dug them all up and took them away, I hear."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Someone... who?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I don't really know either, but I think it was an outsider, at least. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It does seem strange that this settlement, as insular as it was, would give nearly all its cherry trees away to an outsider, though."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"They were a rare variety, apparently. A cherry you only find around the Arata settlement, they say. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Though apparently they didn't let go of the one at the Niimura main house."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mmm... What a truly strange place... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">An insular settlement, 10 years of curse-killings... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, as a person. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Honestly... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="14" RUBY="ク">Qu</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">e </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="ドローガ">droga</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> of a place..." [TN: 'Que droga' is Portuguese, printed in Latin script in the source.]</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what did you just say!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Huh? Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> suddenly raised her voice by an octave.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Just now, you said Droga..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's Portuguese, apparently. What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Droga is... a special drug they used to make here in the Arata settlement, long ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Supposedly it lets a person use 100% of their strength. The first batch was made a full 500 years ago, apparently."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "600" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―And then <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> explained Droga in more detail.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh. But that doesn't have much to do with the curse-killings, does it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"No, no, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">. Some little thing might turn out to be connected. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　That said, working it out from here is a bit much... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">We're about to come face to face with the suspect, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, aren't we?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Right. Keep a poker face as much as you can, please. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What I want isn't to corner </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. I want to prove </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is innocent. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Time and again, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has been suspected of being the culprit, but no evidence has ever turned up. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Even so, I think </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is suspicious."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her head may think he's the culprit, but her heart wants to deny it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Between parent and child, it's only natural to feel that way.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"But there's no proof that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> is the culprit, is there? Just that the way he had you hunt was unnatural..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... That's right. Because learning to handle a nata or a mace is normal for anyone from Arata, but we sisters are the only ones made to keep using them for real, all this time..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mmm... No proof... But there's something like circumstantial evidence... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">It's kind of creepy... How do I put it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> being made the culprit no matter what... It's like I can sense someone out there intending that..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"You mean the culprit is someone else?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"I can't say for sure, but that's entirely possible. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Letting </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">'s shadow flicker faintly into view... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">No, it's almost as if </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> himself is playing the part of the culprit..."</STYLE><PG>
What does that mean?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As usual, I couldn't see what <STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE> was thinking.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Oh, one more thing to confirm: the police haven't been told about these curse-killings or about </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">'s death, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Seems that way. </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> says she doesn't want to hand anyone from this settlement over to the police..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Hmm, hmm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">Got it! I don't have hard proof yet, but I can see the general background now, so don't worry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">!"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Really!? </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> isn't the culprit!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Sorry, but I can't say any more than this. I'd like everyone to act just the way you are now, as much as possible. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">If you hear my theory and let something slip, someone might pick up on it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> seems to be a frighteningly smart man."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Also, the accounts of the people in Arata will probably contradict each other, just very slightly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">So in the conversations from here on, watch out for that one thing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
True. If the culprit is hiding among the settlement's people, a contradiction should turn up somewhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if it hasn't come to light in these 10 years, the contradiction must be that <STYLE ID="16" RUBY="ささい">trivial</STYLE> and inconspicuous.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll keep an eye out for it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
