{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Then the door of the abandoned hut opened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Ah, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, there you are! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Geez, not moving when you're lost is the most basic rule there is, isn't it!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
