{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Well, that's true! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　The ladder's up, so we can get through now! Hurry, let's go!"</STYLE><PG>
If <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> <STYLE ID="17" RUBY="そそのか">put her up to it</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="5">this girl</STYLE> would come after us...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s smile was too innocent for me to believe it right away.
